<title>GERMANY: Buba says November M3 data due shortly.</title>
<headline>Buba says November M3 data due shortly.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank said on Wednesday it would release German M3 money supply data for November shortly.</p>
<p>M3 grew at an annualised rate of 8.4 percent in October.</p>
<p>The Bundesbank's target range for 1996 M3 money supply growth is four to seven percent.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
